# 25 - OPTIMIZE, ZORDER, VACUUM (Delta Practical) (Databricks Must)

This practical covers:
- small files problem
- OPTIMIZE
- ZORDER BY
- VACUUM
- when to use each
- best practices

---

## 0) Setup

Use Databricks.

---

## 1) Create Delta Table with Small Files

Small files are created when:
- you write many times in append
- streaming writes micro-batches
- too many partitions

```python
from pyspark.sql.functions import col

df = spark.range(1, 500000)     .withColumn("dept_id", (col("id") % 10).cast("int"))     .withColumn("salary", (col("id") * 10).cast("int"))

delta_path = "/tmp/delta/employees_optimize"

df.repartition(200).write.format("delta")     .mode("overwrite")     .partitionBy("dept_id")     .save(delta_path)
```

---

## 2) Create External Delta Table

```python
spark.sql(f"""
CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS de_portfolio.employees_optimize
USING DELTA
LOCATION '{delta_path}'
""")
```

---

## 3) Small Files Problem

If there are many files:
- Spark reads too many files
- query becomes slow

---

## 4) OPTIMIZE

OPTIMIZE compacts small files into bigger files.

```python
spark.sql("OPTIMIZE de_portfolio.employees_optimize")
```

---

## 5) ZORDER BY

ZORDER improves performance for filter queries.

Example: queries filter on salary

```python
spark.sql("OPTIMIZE de_portfolio.employees_optimize ZORDER BY (salary)")
```

---

## 6) VACUUM

VACUUM removes old files not needed for time travel.

Default retention = 7 days (168 hours).

```python
spark.sql("VACUUM de_portfolio.employees_optimize")
```

---

## 7) Change Retention (Not recommended in prod without care)

```python
spark.sql("VACUUM de_portfolio.employees_optimize RETAIN 24 HOURS")
```

⚠️ Do this only if your org policy allows.

---

## 8) Best Practices

✅ Run OPTIMIZE daily/weekly for large tables  
✅ Use ZORDER on frequently filtered columns  
✅ Avoid too many partitions  
✅ Use VACUUM carefully (time travel requirement)  
✅ Use auto optimize in Databricks if available  

---

## 9) Summary

- OPTIMIZE compacts small files.
- ZORDER improves pruning and query speed.
- VACUUM removes old unused files.
- These are core Delta Lake optimizations.

